OL,3,GNEWSAStormont to review trials of the
OL,4,Afacts after Eleanor Donaldson case
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont's justice and health ministers
OL,7,Fhave launched a joint review of the
OL,8,Flegal framework on trials of the facts
OL,9,Fin the wake of the Donaldson trial, BBC
OL,10,FNews NI understands.
OL,12,FThat's according to a letter from the
OL,13,FDepartment of Justice's assembly
OL,14,Fliaison officer.
OL,16,FEleanor Donaldson, wife of convicted
OL,17,Fsex offender Jeffrey Donaldson, had
OL,18,Ffaced a trial of the facts after being
OL,19,Ffound unfit for a conventional trial on
OL,20,Fmental health grounds.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
