OL,3,GNEWSAStormont to review trials of the
OL,4,Afacts after Eleanor Donaldson case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ministers will appoint an external
OL,7,Freviewer with the review aiming to
OL,8,Flaunch in late October and conclude by
OL,9,Fthe end of February 2027.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
